   "static_potential_shift_abs_SPARC_sz21": 1.05,
   "verdict": "[D] With constant lambda_s, Cosh enters M_gap^2 < 0 (all-k tachyon/instability) at early times and matches TARGET_D5 sec 3.5's ~1.9-2.2/e-fold vector growing mode at SZ21 Fig 1 (a = 1e-4, gamma_0/H ~ 2.0-2.2, plus UV rate gamma_UV/H >> 1 at large k). With covariant running lambda_s(Q) = lambda_s0 + (K_2/(2-K_B))*(cosh Z - 1) at PR #226 (and the linear-onset K1/(2*(2-K_B)*Q) envelope at SZ21 Fig 1), M_gap^2 > 0 and 0 <= c_{s,IR}^2 < c_{s,UV}^2 < 1 hold globally across a in [1e-10, 1] without changing G_cosmo/G_N at BBN (since Ybar == 0), while the PR #226 SPARC shift |d(lambda)/lambda| is suppressed to O(Phi^2) ~ 6.7e-6."
  },
  "combined_dust_plus_q4_tracker": {
   "exact_AM_GM_floor": "6 * (4 * K_2^2 * c * Q_0^2)^(1/3) at Qbar_* = (K_2*Q_0/(4*c))^(1/3) [D]",
   "required_cQ02_for_global_running_pr226_Mpc_inv2": 12.5545,
   "max_cQ02_no_today_overclosure_Mpc_inv2": 7.9167e-06,
   "overclosure_rho_phi_Q0_over_rho_crit0_at_min_cQ02": 412320.0,
   "obstruction_gap_factor": 1585800.0,
   "verdict": "[D]/[X] At PR #226 (K_B = 0.008, K_2 = 300), avoiding the AM-GM incompatibility dip at intermediate Qbar_* requires c*Q_0^2 >= 12.55 Mpc^-2, whereas avoiding overclosure at Q_0 today (Om_phi <= 0.26) caps c*Q_0^2 <= 7.92e-06 Mpc^-2 -- a 1.59e+06x gap (overcloses today by 4.1e+05x). Thus unshifted U(Q) = 2*K_2*(Q - Q_0)^2 + c*Q^4 hits an unavoidable instability dip even with running lambda_s(Q)."
  }
 }
